-- The default sits on a rule the drawn rule reaches through HENCE, not on the
-- drawn rule itself: it is part of the same process, so it is reported with it.
DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF Filer
DECLARE Action IS ONE OF file, acknowledge

GIVEN `is complete` IS A BOOLEAN TYPICALLY TRUE
GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
`the acknowledgement` MEANS
    PARTY Filer
    MUST acknowledge
    PROVIDED `is complete`
    WITHIN 7

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
`the filing` MEANS
    PARTY Filer
    MUST file
    WITHIN 30
    HENCE `the acknowledgement` TRUE
